  "description": "SPARTA C-GRID FIT – PERFECT FOR CITY ADVENTURES\nWhy take public transport when the SPARTA c-GRID FIT e-bike is already there for you? This agile e-bike effortlessly navigates narrow streets, bridges, and hairpin bends, allowing you to enjoy every ride through the city. The c-GRID FIT focuses on the essentials: comfort, speed, and smart technology, all wrapped in an elegant design. For urban commutes, this e-bike is the ideal choice, making miles on the bus, tram, or car a thing of the past.\nWith its sporty design, the c-GRID FIT offers a comfortable, active riding position, perfect for city rides. The bike is equipped with the reliable Bosch BES3 smart system. Using the LED Remote, you can easily connect your e-bike to the Bosch eBike Flow app on your smartphone, allowing you to fully manage and personalize your ride. Thanks to the standard 500Wh battery, even longer rides are no problem.\nFast, agile, and reliable: the c-GRID FIT makes every city ride easy, enjoyable, and comfortable. Hop on and discover the city in a whole new way.\n\nThe retail price of this e-bike includes VAT and excludes a €4.50 battery recycling fee in the Netherlands. Please note: specifications may vary. Consult the product details for the exact specifications or contact your dealer.",
